 Soldier Serum they  used the serum to control his mind and  we'll talk about that in a bit and that  leads us to the second thing that you  probably noticed about this video and  that is the fact that there is no Sam  there is no Falcon in this scene so  unless Sam is actually doing a different  objective on the same mission he's not  involved in this and it may because he's  decided to stay out of the government  business  since for whatever reason he is not the  current Captain America it's John Walker  number three the choreography of this  scene is actually quite good it's a very  good fight scene but this actually does  reveal a lot about John Walker as we see  him fight we noticed he's not a very  skilled fighter he's actually kind of a  sloppy fighter and kind of a brawler  when he fights we can see him swing and  miss punches and we can also see them  hit him several times and he misses his  punches several times as well so we can  see that as he fights he's kind of a  scrappy fighter and this is very  different than Steve Rogers he was more  of a calculated and very skilled  hand-to-hand combat fighter but luckily  as we can tell he does have the Super  Soldier Serum which is the fourth a big  reveal about this it was uncertain on  whether or not the new Captain America  would get some type of Super Soldier  Serum but as we can tell from this video  he definitely does because you can tell  how strong he is in this video he's able  to take a lot of punches and not really  be that affected by it and we can see  that when he hits people they kind of go  flying and at one point in time he does  throw somebody a pretty far away so he  does have the serum which is really good  because his fighting skills aren't  really up to par with the old Captain  America's which leads us to point number  five which is kind of a big deal and  that is that he doesn't really know how  Captain America used to fight this is a  pretty big deal and it's very revealing  because in t